            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Jarvis Pro arrives.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.28</h2>
<ul>
  <li>New Settings → Plan shows your Jarvis plan. If you have been with Jarvis from the start, it reads "Jarvis Pro — On the house": thank you.</li>
  <li>Settings → Account now has a Sign in button whenever you are signed out.</li>
  <li>Nothing changes in how Jarvis works today. Plans and a 7-day trial for new people will follow in a later update.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
